==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Nidoqueen|56}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Nidoqueen}}.
*'''Lovestrike''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Plasma Freeze|Nidoking|58}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Freeze}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

